<title>GREECE: ATHLETICS-PINTUSSEVICH WINS WORLD WOMEN'S 200 METRES TITLE.</title>
<headline>ATHLETICS-PINTUSSEVICH WINS WORLD WOMEN'S 200 METRES TITLE.</headline>
<dateline>ATHENS 1997-08-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Ukrainian Zhanna Pintussevich won the world women's 200 metres gold medal on Friday.</p>
<p>Susanthika Jayasinghe of Sri Lanka took the silver and Jamaican Merlene Ottey the  bronze.</p>
</text>
